    <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgAW8oq8CrzCOnp9efLCM2GcQPQO.jpg"><p><strong><span>Intro：</span></strong></p><p><span>当想要买东西的时候，就问问自己，是你真的需要这样东西？还是希望别人知道你拥有它？</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FneYX9dPMbpCXPz_s_MnFCGKRPZj.jpg"><p><strong><span>本期您将听到：</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="148">02:28</a>&nbsp;聊挣钱真不会，聊怎么亏钱的好像还行</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="275">04:35</a>&nbsp;不要接盘任何老登资产</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="463">07:43</a>&nbsp;第一类，稀缺性是被制造出来的：文玩核桃、君子兰、文竹</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1891">31:31</a> 第二类，共识消失后导致的流动性消失：普洱茶、紫砂壶、钻石、AJ</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3048">50:48</a> 第三类，购买者、持有者变了：邮票、HIFI耳机、钢琴</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4048">01:07:28</a> 第四类，荒诞的消费主义：藏獒</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>BGM：</span></strong></p><p><span>In my imagination - Sød Ven</span></p><p></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuiAGjOJhyS4EohJnc1kIb5l-o1e.jpg"><p></p>]]></description>
