  <item>
    <title>Ep068.#我爱南京#南京风物志：那些消失的儿时吃食</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a01db49e1eb34a93930d8cf</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a01db49e1eb34a93930d8cf</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 12 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p></p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9ub3MubmV0ZWFzZS5jb20veXlpbWdzL3pMZ0VUelRvaWdaRlhMZ24yS3FfZkE9PS8xMDk5NTExNzMwNDQ4ODA1NjE="><p><strong><span>Intro：</span></strong></p><p><span>那些笨拙的、甜腻的、带着香精和油烟气的味道，替我们在匮乏的年代里创造过最真实的快乐。</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong><span>本期您将听到：</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="143">02:23</a>&nbsp;为什么南京大牌档遭人嫌？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="302">05:02</a>&nbsp;对于00后的小叶而言，她选的难忘食物是——健达巧克力（老于记错了！）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="663">11:03</a>&nbsp;大哥大、城南炸串、炒米、炒汤圆（人类猫砂球）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1442">24:02</a> 冷饮三巨头：马头牌冰棒、美登高、三色冰激凌</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrMzKPThdGVg4R2aQJJ9zs1EHg8O.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpg74nf2XhSvG-5ylJerI5v-wlkb.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh2Wacru9k1mn-57CzmZeDOKRfmD.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2817">46:57</a> 南京克系美食——活珠子、毛蛋、旺鸡蛋这是一个东西嘛？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3083">51:23</a> 消失的湖南路，和已经变了的天偿里脊</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3594">59:54</a> 消失的辣条……它和如今的辣条口味完全不通！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3833">01:03:53</a> Q&amp;A环节</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkc_djmoXg2iz3jjaK9aMOq2Z9zt.jpg"></figure><p><strong><span>BGM：</span></strong></p><p><span>藤井風- 真っ白 (纯白)</span></p><p></p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9ub3MubmV0ZWFzZS5jb20veXlpbWdzL2hSQ0pHM2h3MzJIel9EVHVpb3ByTkE9PS8xMDk5NTExNzMwNDQ4NzQzMDc="><p></p>]]></description>
